<title>USA: MRV Communications, Digital in pact.</title>
<headline>MRV Communications, Digital in pact.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>MRV Communications Inc said it has signed a joint development deal with Digital Equipment Corp for certain future local area network (LAN) switching products.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>MRV Communications supplies LAN connectivity products and digital and linear fiber optic transmission products for computer networks, telephony and cable television communications.</p>
</text>
